  - m_Id: 1777000308195328
    m_Localized: 'Damage: {0}

      Fire Rate: {1}

      Range: {2}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1777597027631104
    m_Localized: "Damage: {0} -> {1}\r\nFire Rate: {2} -> {3}\r\nRange: {4} -> {5}\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1777665763885056
    m_Localized: 'Life:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1777621329428480
    m_Localized: 'Damage: {0} -> {1}

      Fire Rate: {2} -> {3}

      Range: {4}
      -> {5}

      Target Amount: {6} -> {7}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1814722607497216
    m_Localized: Do you wish to follow the path of infestation?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1814767343943680
    m_Localized: " You\u2019ve just been inserted into a human body. Your mission
      is to infect it organ by organ, starting here. But beware \u2014 the immune
      system will do everything to eliminate you.\r\n Adapt. Evolve. Survive."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1814784167297024
    m_Localized: " Let\u2019s begin by setting up your first biological defense.\n
      Click on the base spot to open the placement menu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1814793449291776
    m_Localized: " Now select a BACTERY  \u2014 a fast and cheap unit ideal for early
      waves.\"\n This tower will shoot small energy bursts to destroy incoming antibodies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1814803226214400
    m_Localized: " Well done. Now prepare for your first test \u2014 the immune system
      has detected your presence.\"\n They\u2019re sending basic antibodies. Press
      'Next Wave' to face them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1814809614139392
    m_Localized: " Watch closely: every antibody you destroy gives you DNA, your
      main resource.\n You'll see it increase in the top-left corner of the screen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1814815729434624
    m_Localized: " You\u2019ve survived the first wave \u2014 and earned a new infection
      token!\n These special tokens let you place new towers. You gain one after
      each round."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1814821362384896
    m_Localized: ' Try using the token you just earned to place a new tower on the
      battlefield.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1814826638819328
    m_Localized: This is a Virus, try it out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 1823294728880128
    m_Localized: Yes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1823321132023808
    m_Localized: No
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1823571833962496
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103234489663488
    m_Localized: Bounces to 2 enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103376676569088
    m_Localized: Bounces to 4 enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103336784543744
    m_Localized: Impact explodes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103401334882304
    m_Localized: "Explosion leaves radiation (5 damage/sec for 5s)\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103481987153920
    m_Localized: Slows by 50% for 10s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103579085291520
    m_Localized: Stuns 1s per hit and Slows by 50% for 10s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103534516617216
    m_Localized: 'Bleeding: 10 damage/sec for 10s'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103602942492672
    m_Localized: 'Bleeding: 10 damage/sec for 10s + weakness X2'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103627034574848
    m_Localized: Shoots at 3 enemies at once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103666419089408
    m_Localized: "\rDamage increases for 5 seconds, with a cap of 50"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103685364760576
    m_Localized: Shoots at 5 enemies at once
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2103708685090816
    m_Localized: "\rDamage increases for 5 seconds, with a cap of 66"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14695186390446080
    m_Localized: Lets deal with the next Wave!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 14726377575411712
    m_Localized: It seems that some antybodies managed to damage you, we will get
      you some help this time but the next time is up to you to not let this happend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 14726879222558720
    m_Localized: " You\u2019ve earned enough DNA to evolve your tower, try upgrading
      the VIRUS you recently added."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 14727005169119232
    m_Localized: Before upgrading let me show you how the role sistem works.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 14727009367617536
    m_Localized: "\"A cross icon means it's a support tower \u2014 boost allies,
      or weaken enemies.\""
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 14727128880115712
    m_Localized: " \"A sniper scope means the tower is strong against single targets
      \u2014 perfect for tough, isolated enemies.\"\r\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 14727689306238976
    m_Localized: ' Three bullets indicate it''s a multi-target tower  great for dealing
      with enemy swarms.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 14731051703595008
    m_Localized: Try upgrading to the multyshot variation, if you hover it you can
      see what stats change and the new hability that they get.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  - m_Id: 14735288307150848
    m_Localized: " Excellent work. Now you\u2019re ready to infect freely.\n Place
      more towers, upgrade wisely, and conquer this organ. Your final goal: reach
      the brain.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 1408601354238427151
  references:
